t of his first mission on his  father's behalf that he began to be  troubled by what he was being asked to  do in the name of Peace there Xiang Chi  met his father's Nemesis sir Dennis  Neyland Smith who revealed the true  nature of his father's evil plans for  world domination aghast at the level of  betrayal Xiang Chi turned on his father  he invaded Fu manchu's Lair and declared  they were now enemies over the years  Xiang Chi would make good on his promise  to his father by foiling his plans for  global domination time and again  shangshi was raised to believe in the  utmost importance of family and his clan  unfortunately that belief became the  bane of his existence once he declared  war on his super villain father and the  rest of his criminal family first among  them was midnight Shang Chi's adopted  brother although the two were not  related by blood a solid friendship had  existed between midnight and Shang Chi  from an early age that relationship came  to an end once Fu Manchu ordered  midnight to hunt down and execute his  Rogue brother although shanxi pleaded  with midnight to renounce their father  shanxi was forced to fight midnight to  the death just as tragic was the  relationship between Xiang Chi and his  half-sister fallacy who was later given  the name Zhang Bao Yu after the  aforementioned rights issue over Fu  Manchu although there was no love lost  between Fu Manchu and his daughter her  desire to take her father down was far  from benevolent fallow C led her own  criminal organization and her plan was  to use Shang Chi to get Fu Manchu out of  the way so her own gang could become the  most powerful criminal organization in  the world once again shanxi was forced  to work against his family when he acted  against his sister as well as his father  you are  you are the legacy of your family  the tragedy of shangshi's entire life  has been that while he is deeply  committed to peace It could only be  achieved through the death of his once  beloved father the super villain Fu  Manchu or so shangshi believed to that  end the 1974 comic series Master of Kung  Fu saw Shang Chi tracked down and  seemingly leave Fu Manchu to die but the  passing of Fu Manchu did not bring  shangchi the relief he imagined after  his father's death Xiang chi embarked on  a quest to save his mother who he  imagined was being held against her will  after a long search he was able to  finally track her down in Master of Kung  Fu number 123 but there Xiang Chi  discovered that his mother was no  captive at all but had truly loved Fu  Manchu his mother renounced Shang Chi  for killing his father the young hero  was given the moniker false Son by his  former comrades and mother the mission  that Xiang Chi believed would free the  world and his mother of his father's  evil failed to be the moment of Triumph  he'd so desperately hoped for Shang Chi  discovered that letting his evil father  die was a more complicated act than he  had imagined in 1983's Master of Kung Fu  number 125 shanxi dealt with the loss of  his family and his own conflicted  Feelings by engaging in the last rites  of his father's funeral to fulfill his  duties as a son shanxi returned to Hunan  to pay his last respects even though he  could not bear to call Fu Manchu  honorable father shangshi nevertheless  prayed that his Spirit would find peace  but his musings were interrupted by  demons both real and imagined chongqi  fled to other parts of China in search  of something that would assuage his  feelings of guilt finally after a  Twilight battle against an assassin sent  by his mother chongqi drinks from his  father's ceremonial cup and is able to  come to terms with his actions to a  certain extent but that acceptance comes  at a price as chongqi renounces his past  as a crime fighter and settles down to a  simple life of farming and fishing  chongqi's personal history has always  been defined by the fact that he is the  only child of his super villain father  Fu Manchu who refused to enter into a  Life Of Crime After chongqi refused his  father Fu manchu's orders to work for  his criminal Empire moving Shadow was  called upon to take shangshi's place at  Fu manchu's side moving Shadow was yet  another half brother to Shang Chi and  raised in a similarly brutal fashion to  be the perfect killing weapon but while  Xiang Chi eventually came to see his  father's evil nature moving Shadow was  blindly subservient and completely  willing to kill his half-brother at  their father's behest in the 2002 Marvel  Max series Xiang Chi Master of Kung Fu  moving Shadow came face to face with  Sean Chi and tried hard to kill him no  matter how much song she exhorted him to  see reason moving Shadow was  single-minded in his desire to kill his  brother in the end shangshi emerged a  Victor in their battle but refused to  kill moving Shadow but their father had  no such qualities dismissing moving  Shadow for having failed in his mission  Fu Manchu personally launched a dagger  into his heart in front of Xiang Chi  chongqi has a long history of being part  of superhero teams where his even  tempered nature and top-notch fighting  skills are invariably assets the 2006  series Heroes for hire saw shanxi  working alongside a host of allies  including the insect-powered metahuman  humbug humbug used to be Buchanan midi  an entomology Professor who turned to a  life of crime to fund his research after  constantly being foiled by Spider-Man  humbug decided to join the good guys  which is how he came to be a part of the  super team Heroes for hire in 2006's  Heroes for higher series humbug gets  manipulated by the alien overlord The  Brood Queen while under the influence of  the queen midi ends up betraying his  teammates to The Brew while the team  escapes the brood's prison chongqi rips  humbug's head off  not a good time to lose one's head  Oh indeed  that's not the way to get ahead in life  one of Shang Chi's most memorable  crossovers occurred 