Domino from  his tutelage and their unlikely romantic  relation relationship also ends despite  his extremely violent upbringing chongqi  has managed to stick to a pretty  pacifist path most of the time but the  Master of Kung Fu has strayed from it  from time to time like when he entered  into a pack with the literal Greek God  of War Ares himself the conflict arose  in the backup stories of 2019  swordmaster when Ares and his Legion of  Dragonborn soldiers got into a  confrontation with Shang Chi and  swordmaster ares wanted to get his hands  on Shang Chi's Ally linlier's mystical  sword with which the God of War intended  to kill the kidnapper of his son despite  the misgivings of swordmaster xiangxi  entered into a pack with Ares to Aid him  with the Sword and the retrieval of his  son in return for the god of War's help  in finding Lin lia's missing father  rather predictably the deal goes south  as Aries his son and swordmaster are  forced into a heated battle against Davi  Naka the mother goddess of mad Rapport  although shanxi is able to temporarily  placate the goddess the actions of his  former teammates the Agents of Atlas  lead to an all-out war between the  Surface city of pan and the underwater  city of Atlantis even after  accomplishing his goal of killing his  father and his criminal cohort xiangxi  was not rid of Zhang zhu's Legacy in  2020 Shang Chi series The Master of Kung  Fu discovers that Zhang zhu's Spirit  chose him to be the next supreme  commander of the five weapons Society at  first Shang Chi resists the calling even  after coming into contact with his newly  discovered half-siblings brother saber  and sister dagger but eventually he  agrees to team up with his siblings  shanxi's intention is to rescue his  long-lost full sister shiwa who is  operating as the supervillain sister  hammer and attempting to take control  over the five weapons Society eventually  xiong Chi comes to accept that the only  way to stop the infighting is to accept  his role as the new supreme commander of  the five weapons although he vows to  turn the society into a Force for good  his father's Spirit visits him upon his  coronation mockingly telling him my  drone suits you my son for you are  destined to become like me just like me  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more Looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit  the Bell so you don't miss a single one

